    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/eeda53064cc0bfa583c5df5f907563c1.avif?t=1665690705\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A roguelike deck-building game</h2><br>Dreamshard is a rogue-like card game where slay the spire meets hearthstone. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, fight monsters, craft a unique deck and defeat your enemies to find the secret of the Dreamshard.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.poster.avif?t=1665690705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.webm?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.mp4?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique gameplay that blends rogue-like deck builders with CCG.<br></li><li> New procedurally generated dungeons each game<br></li><li> Many monsters with unique abilities and interesting decks.<br></li><li> Many cards and a chance to create combo decks.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.poster.avif?t=1665690705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.webm?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.mp4?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1665690705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/eeda53064cc0bfa583c5df5f907563c1.avif?t=1665690705\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A roguelike deck-building game</h2><br>Dreamshard is a rogue-like card game where slay the spire meets hearthstone. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, fight monsters, craft a unique deck and defeat your enemies to find the secret of the Dreamshard.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.poster.avif?t=1665690705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.webm?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/0ce6662b99d41102f21ca9a86c80c7e7.mp4?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique gameplay that blends rogue-like deck builders with CCG.<br></li><li> New procedurally generated dungeons each game<br></li><li> Many monsters with unique abilities and interesting decks.<br></li><li> Many cards and a chance to create combo decks.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.poster.avif?t=1665690705\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.webm?t=1665690705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1133340/extras/d23b262e196c1bae446b0b385a7af26d.mp4?t=1665690705\" type=\"video